Author: Adrian Bunk <bunk@debian.org>

Index: VTK-9.3.0/GUISupport/Qt/vtkQWidgetTexture.cxx
===================================================================
--- VTK-9.3.0.orig/GUISupport/Qt/vtkQWidgetTexture.cxx
